{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07把亲密带来的幸福进一步转向“对方是否也需要我、是否能从我这里获得安心”，使快乐部分变成被需要的确认。\",\n    \"S13又把留不住亲密的痛具体收窄为“有一天对方不再需要我”，使失去亲近与失去自身被需要的价值过度绑定。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03删去了想确认对方是否也有同样感受的念头，弱化了亲密中的相互回应。\",\n    \"S07删去了对方也可能需要陪伴、能从相处中获得安心这一层，使双方相互依恋的意味稍弱。\",\n    \"S12删去了不计较对方是否同样在乎、只想把能给的都给对方这一层，弱化了主动给予的情感面向。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y更直接地围绕两个人亲近时的幸福，以及这种共同相处可能无法长久的痛楚展开。X虽然也包含这些内容，但反复把幸福和失去转化为“对方是否需要我”的具体顾虑，因而把Center收窄到了一个相近但不完全相同的主题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fc6ddfba-b9cb-44b4-9e61-4a8382a6f3f3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T084409153375Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.765, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:44:44.942417+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7bf26667068fd9b7ca7bc84d525531c04c3df716670c64911c2a48fdfbf86887", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308